son":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4e79ddb81ca400c5f2827450b6c45ecb9c5d81bf -- contains the bug.\n- 0b3dc97fba7d82d4401bf1a452d27e35a28a4f18 (1 before) -- works.\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nDodge-the-creeps in Rust started crashing with:\n```\ndouble free or corruption (!prev)\n```\n\nI bisected the Godot versions and **narrowed the use-after-free down to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118548.** \n\n---\n\nThere might be an issue with ownership, since `placeholder_extension->gdtype = ti->gdtype;` now shares the `gdtype` but still destroys it in its destructor.\n\nDuring hot-reload:\n```py\nGDExtension::_unregister_extension_class(...)\n   if (ext->is_reloading)\n        GDExtension::_clear_extension(ext)\n             p_extension->gdextension.destroy_gdtype()\n                  memdelete(gdtype)          # first free\n\n# later in the same unregister flow:\nGDExtension::_unregister_extension_class(...)\n   ClassDB::unregister_extension_class(class_name, !ext->is_reloading)\n        placeholder_extensions.erase(class_name)\n             ObjectGDExtension::~ObjectGDExtension()\n                  memdelete(gdtype)          # second free\n```\n\nNormal unregister/shutdown:\n```py\nGDExtension::_unregister_extension_class(...)\n   ClassDB::unregister_extension_class(class_name, ...)\n        placeholder_extensions.erase(class_name)\n             ObjectGDExtension::~ObjectGDExtension()\n                  memdelete(gdtype)          # first free\n\n# later in class teardown:\nGDExtension::_unregister_extension_class(...)\n   self->extension_classes.erase(class_name)\n        (destruction of Extension::gdextension)\n             ObjectGDExtension::~ObjectGDExtension()\n                  memdelete(gdtype)          # second free\n```\n\ncc @dsnopek\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nManually build Godot with revision 4e79ddb81ca400c5f2827450b6c45ecb9c5d81bf or newer.\n\nClone https://github.com/godot-rust/demo-projects, run:\n```py\ncargo build -p dodge-the-creeps\ngodot --path dodge-the-creeps/godot -e --quit\n```\nOutput:\n```c\ndouble free or corruption (!prev)\n[1]    1704995 IOT instruction (core dumped)  godot --path dodge-the-creeps/godot -e --quit\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118754/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118754/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}